    2. pick one foreground color from 1..9
    3. fill an N x N grid with black, then randomly set ~30-50% of cells to the foreground color
    4. ensure both colors appear in every row and every column (resample if not)
    5. output = np.tile(np.where(grid==0, fg, 0), (2,2))
